WEBVTT

00:07:58.349 --> 00:08:01.644
that are involved in planning
the activities,

00:08:01.685 --> 00:08:05.648
and they also walk with us
when we need them.

00:08:05.689 --> 00:08:07.233
So that's very exciting.

00:08:07.942 --> 00:08:09.109
CA: Wow.

00:08:09.944 --> 00:08:11.153
(Laughs)

00:08:11.153 --> 00:08:14.031
Nizar, tell us more about this
extraordinary artistic vision,

00:08:14.031 --> 00:08:16.784
this creation, this little girl.

00:08:16.784 --> 00:08:19.995
ANZ: She is very,
very warmly received everywhere.

00:08:20.412 --> 00:08:25.334
And the events try to capture
the hardship of her experiences.

00:08:25.376 --> 00:08:29.338
Some of the events are very sad in a way,

00:08:29.380 --> 00:08:31.799
but very honest to the refugee experience.